anets and black holes in the vastness of space. Endure dangerous lava landscapes and erupting volcanos, survive encounters with alien wildlife and navigate through asteroids filled with electrically charged plasma.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/f3f8340a0bb50b58f8748089394b915e.webp?t=1763982060\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/f3f8340a0bb50b58f8748089394b915e.poster.webp?t=1763982060\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=342 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your drill to defeat enemies, activate special abilities to triumph in battle, and liberate the space stations occupied by pirates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/760ba3e11eb504b7f66147d5531a5174.poster.avif?t=1763982060\" width=780 height=314 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/760ba3e11eb504b7f66147d5531a5174.webm?t=1763982060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/760ba3e11eb504b7f66147d5531a5174.mp4?t=1763982060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Morse Morse Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/910b19ab03841c54e98c5eaeba83f4948b3c20ff/header.jpg?t=1763982060","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3722660/1262026839/5063b61